			"notes": "```yaml\nChanges:\n  - Added `/voteparty forceparty` with permission `votereward.voteparty.force` to immediately pass out rewards.\n    - Does not reset the vote party count.\n  - Added `MessageInterval` to the VoteParty section. Default 1. This is how to turn down how many vote messages are sent.\n    - Example: a MessageInterval of 2 would send the `OnVoteMessage` every 2 votes.\n  - `/voteparty set` will now execute the vote party if set above the current amount.\n  - Fixed VoteParty.PerPlayerCommands using the incorrect player names.\n```"
		},
